---
const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
---
<footer class="ftr">
  <div class="wrap ftr-inner">
    <div class="ftr-col ftr-brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">▮</span>
      <span class="brand-word">stack.</span>
      <p class="dim small">A working name. Replace when the project has one.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ftr-col">
      <h4>Project</h4>
      <p>Independent demo artifact built during pre-hack workshops at Burning Token. Not an official Burning Token product.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ftr-col">
      <h4>What is not here</h4>
      <p>No sponsor logos. No testimonials. No platform or API access claims. No deployment in this build.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ftr-col">
      <h4>Status</h4>
      <p>Vertical demo · Workshop 1 artifact · not deployed.</p>
      <p>Last touched: <time>{today}</time></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap ftr-bottom">
    <div>Built with Astro · local preview only</div>
    <div>No account, no keys, no tracking in this build.</div>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  .ftr {
    background: var(--frame);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .ftr-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .ftr-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .ftr-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .ftr-brand { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; align-content: start; }
  .brand-mark {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.7rem;
    height: 1.7rem;
    background: var(--magenta);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .brand-word {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .ftr h4 {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--magenta);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ftr p {
    color: rgb(249 245 239 / 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .dim { color: rgb(249 245 239 / 0.55); }
  .small { font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .ftr-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgb(249 245 239 / 0.15);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgb(249 245 239 / 0.55);
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
